onal injuries and illnesses by industry and case types, 2006. <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.bls.gov/iif/oshwc/osh/os/ostb1765.pdf">http://www.bls.gov/iif/oshwc/osh/os/ostb1765.pdf</ext-link></citation></ref><ref id="CR20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wesseling</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Joode</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Monge</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Pesticide-related illness and injuries among banana workers in Costa Rica: a comparison between 1993 and 1996</article-title><source>Int J Occup Environ Health</source><year>2001</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>90</fpage><lpage>97</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Wesseling C, de Joode B, Monge P (2001) Pesticide-related illness and injuries among banana workers in Costa Rica: a comparison between 1993 and 1996. Int J Occup Environ Health 7:90&#x02013;97 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11373051</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yassin</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name><name><surname>Abu Mourad</surname><given-names>TA</given-names></name><name><surname>Safi</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Knowledge, attitude, practice, and toxicity symptoms associated with pesticide use among farm workers in the Gaza Strip</article-title><source>Occup Environ Med</source><year>2002</year><volume>59</volume><fpage>387</fpage><lpage>394</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/oem.59.6.387</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Yassin MM, Abu Mourad TA, Safi JM (2002) Knowledge, attitude, practice, and toxicity symptoms associated with pesticide use among farm workers in the Gaza Strip. Occup Environ Med 59:387&#x02013;394. doi:10.1136/oem.59.6.387 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12040114</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>